# Line endings
# core.autocrlf=true would rewrite these to CRLF in the working tree, which (a) makes
# Keystatic/script-written content show spurious whole-file diffs and (b) breaks the
# shell pre-commit hook (a CRLF shebang => "bad interpreter"). Pin them to LF.
content/**      text eol=lf
.githooks/**    text eol=lf
*.sh            text eol=lf
